<p>Hey! I am here from summon on SCPD Discord!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Crit</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
